 》（ 2021年02月22日 14 版）。</p>\n<p>原文链接（转载需获授权）：http://sports.people.com.cn/n1/2021/0222/c14820-32033262.html</p>"},"related":[{"id":"n_mu9nc1d8h23g12","createdAt":"2026-09-20T10:01:08.588Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T14:30:48.640Z","title":"中国选手潘展乐获得男子100米自由泳冠军","subtitle":"","summary":"中新网9月20日电(记者 朱晨曦 周昕)当地时间9月20日，在爱知·名古屋亚运会游泳项目男子100米自由泳决赛中，中国选手、世界纪录保持者潘展乐以47秒61获得冠军，另一名中国选手张展硕排名第四。","channel":"sports","tags":["体育"],"author":"中新网·体育","source":"中新网·体育","sourceUrl":"https://www.chinanews.com.cn/ty/2026/09-20/10700230.shtml","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu9nc1d8h23g12-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":true,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":7},"stats":{"views":1,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":1,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-20T09:28:23.000Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu9nb047qzbb55","channelName":"体育","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.79},{"id":"n_mu9nc1e75kdtsb","createdAt":"2026-09-20T10:01:08.623Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T14:30:48.644Z","title":"亚运会 | 女子50米蛙泳唐钱婷成功卫冕","subtitle":"","summary":"新华社东京9月20日电 在刚刚结束的爱知·名古屋亚运会女子50米蛙泳比赛中，中国队选手唐钱婷成功卫冕。","channel":"sports","tags":["体育","亚运会"],"author":"中新网·体育","source":"中新网·体育","sourceUrl":"https://www.chinanews.com.cn/ty/2026/09-20/10700228.shtml","cover":"./img/news/i-mu9nb0491dqszo-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":true,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":7},"stats":{"views":1,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":1,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-20T09:19:42.000Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu9nb0491dqszo","channelName":"体育","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.77},{"id":"n_mu9nc1f5k2zhyz","createdAt":"2026-09-20T10:01:08.657Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T14:30:48.646Z","title":"亚运会 | 男子100米自由泳潘展乐成功卫冕","subtitle":"","summary":"新华社东京9月20日电 在